Each applicant for membership in the Corporation shall meet the qualifications, 
financial responsibility, operational capability and business history requirements as 
applicable to its membership type.  Following an applicant’s admission to membership 
in the Corporation, it shall be required to continue meeting the qualifications, financial 
responsibility, operational capability and business history requirements as applicable to 
its membership type. 
An applicant must demonstrate (i) that it has sufficient financial ability to meet all 
of its anticipated obligations to the Corporation and, (ii) if applicable to its membership 
type, that it has sufficient financial ability to make anticipated contributions to the 
Clearing Fund. 
